              ]
            },
            "description": "📧 Send an email request to Kafka queue.\n\n🔄 Process flow:\n1. API receives email request\n2. Message sent to Kafka topic: email-queue\n3. Kafka consumer processes the message asynchronously\n4. Email sent (or logged in test mode)\n\n📝 Email data:\n- to: Recipient email address (required)\n- subject: Email subject (required)\n- body: Email content (required)\n- from: Sender email address (optional)\n\n✅ Check logs:\n- logs/kafka/kafka-detail.log - Kafka processing\n- logs/spring-jwt.log - General application logs"
